Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 4

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P004

Summary: Passive MK7 environmental states and reward evaluation

Description: |
    Extends P003 buffered CSV telemetry with experimental ground,
    underwater, airborne, gliding classification and separate
    glider-pad and ordinary boost-pad activations. Calculates
    provisional progress/time/lap rewards only; no driver,
    machine learning, game-memory writes or automatic saving.
    These new mode signals require real 3DS verification.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
